<title>UK: UK Jan 28 gilt auction announcement - full details.</title>
<headline>UK Jan 28 gilt auction announcement - full details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 2.5 BLN STG</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.25 PERCENT</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2007</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: JANUARY 28</p>
<p>NOTES: The stock will be strippable when strips facility is introduced. The interest will accrue from January 29 and the first payment will be made on June 7 at a rate of 2.5623 stg per 100 stg nominal stock.</p>
</text>
